嗯，让我再想想。选项2是"Keep quiet in the room and clarify in writing after the meeting"。这不算撒谎——它选择在会后以书面形式澄清，避免当场破坏评审。这符合"facts, evidence and a timeline, politely, in writing where possible"（书面澄清）。这实际上符合技能中的建议："Credit or blame disputes: facts, evidence and a timeline, politely, in writing where possible."

但选项1是当场说真话。哪个更好？

